DuplicateTag objects\weapons\rifle\assault_rifle\shaders\display.shader ramp\objects\weapons\rifle\smg\shaders\display
EditTag ramp\objects\weapons\rifle\smg\shaders\display.shader
SetBitmap self_illum_map ramp\objects\weapons\rifle\smg\bitmaps\smg_sight_display.bitmap

SetArgument base_map 0.01 17 0 1
SetArgument albedo_color 0.16078432 0 0 1
SetArgument self_illum_color 1 0 0 1
SaveTagChanges
